OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786434481
OL,3,CBurnham to give councils more powers
OL,4,Cto crack down on new betting and vape
OL,5,Cshops
OL,7,FAndy Burnham has pledged to give
OL,8,Fcouncils greater powers to block new
OL,9,Fbookmakers and vape shops in a bid to
OL,10,Fsave Britain's "hollowed-out high
OL,11,Fstreets".
OL,13,FThe prime minister intends to scrap
OL,14,Fthe so-called "aim to permit" rule,
OL,15,Fwhich limits local authorities'
OL,16,Fability to prevent betting shops and
OL,17,F24-hour slot machine venues from
OL,18,Fopening in their area.
OL,26,@rD@POUsD@HO]vD@OOUvD@]O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786434481
OL,3,CBurnham to give councils more powers
OL,4,Cto crack down on new betting and vape
OL,5,Cshops
OL,7,FPlanning permission will also be
OL,8,Frequired for outlets selling e-
OL,9,Fcigarettes, as part of efforts to give
OL,10,Fcommunities a greater say over what
OL,11,Fopens on their high streets.
OL,13,FThe formal definition of a vape shop
OL,14,Fwill be tightened to prevent
OL,15,Fbusinesses from sidestepping the new
OL,16,Frules by describing themselves as a
OL,17,F"convenience store" or other retailer,
OL,18,Fofficials said.
OL,26,@yD@AOUyD@SO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786434481
OL,3,CBurnham to give councils more powers
OL,4,Cto crack down on new betting and vape
OL,5,Cshops
OL,7,FAdult gaming centres offering up to 24-
OL,8,Fhour access to slot and fruit machines
OL,9,Fwill also require planning permission
OL,10,Funder the shake-up, which is expected
OL,11,Fto come into effect at the start of
OL,12,Fnext year.
OL,14,FUnder proposals first announced by
OL,15,FKeir Starmer's government, police will
OL,16,Falso be able to shut down "dodgy"
OL,17,Fbarbers, vape shops, and nail salons
OL,18,Ffor up to a year.
OL,26,@xD@[OUxD@aO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786434481
OL,3,CBurnham to give councils more powers
OL,4,Cto crack down on new betting and vape
OL,5,Cshops
OL,7,FThe maximum length of so-called
OL,8,F"closure orders" will be extended from
OL,9,Fsix months to 12, giving officers more
OL,10,Ftime to investigate premises linked to
OL,11,Forganised crime.
OL,13,FOfficials said the government would
OL,14,Falso set clearer expectations for the
OL,15,Fdesign of high-street shopfronts, to
OL,16,Fimprove their appearance and prevent
OL,17,Fcomplaints about "garish neon signs"
OL,18,Fand "oversized logos".
OL,26,@yD@ROUyD@dO]zD@EOUzD@UO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/15
