OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786434481
OL,3,CBurnham to give councils more powers
OL,4,Cto crack down on new betting and vape
OL,5,Cshops
OL,7,FWorking with local authorities, it
OL,8,Fwill publish "practical guidance" for
OL,9,Fcouncils on how to make town centres
OL,10,Fmore attractive, they said.
OL,12,FThe "aim to permit" policy was
OL,13,Fintroduced during Tony Blair's
OL,14,Fpremiership, when Burnham was a
OL,15,Fminister, and liberalised gambling
OL,16,Flaws in 2005.
OL,18,FThe prime minister will spend much of
OL,19,Fthe rest of August travelling around
OL,20,Fthe country asking people how the
OL,21,Fgovernment can improve their lives.
OL,26,@pD@NOUpD@aO]tD@EOUtD@SO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/15
