CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786434481
OL,3,CBurnham to give councils more powers
OL,4,Cto crack down on new betting and vape
OL,5,Cshops
OL,7,FOfficials have said he will be in
OL,8,F"listening mode", while also focusing
OL,9,Fon reviving high streets and tackling
OL,10,Fthe cost of living.
OL,12,FBut he is under pressure over his
OL,13,Fhandling of the prisoner-release row,
OL,14,Fas two of PC Andrew Harper's killers
OL,15,Fare still to be freed early despite
OL,16,FBurnham's review of the plans.
OL,26,@pD@AOUpD@PO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/15
