OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30607
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786434481
OL,3,CBurnham to give councils more powers
OL,4,Cto crack down on new betting and vape
OL,5,Cshops
OL,7,FBurnham said Tuesday's announcement
OL,8,Fwould help put local communities "back
OL,9,Fin control" and allow councils to
OL,10,Ftighten the spread of unwanted shops
OL,11,Fand bring town centres back to life.
OL,13,FHe said: "For many people, the high
OL,14,Fstreets they grew up with have been
OL,15,Fhollowed out and become unrecognisable
OL,16,Fover decades of decline.
OL,18,F"The rise of vape shops, betting shops
OL,19,Fand rogue operators have replaced the
OL,20,Fshops, services, and community spaces
OL,21,Fthat people are crying out for.
OL,26,@pD@bOUqD@KO]uD@JOUzD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30608
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786434481
OL,3,CBurnham to give councils more powers
OL,4,Cto crack down on new betting and vape
OL,5,Cshops
OL,7,F"That's not on. I said we would
OL,8,Fimprove Britain's high streets, and
OL,9,Fthat's exactly what we are starting to
OL,10,Fdo."
OL,12,FHe added: "High streets are the
OL,13,Fbeating heart of local communities,
OL,14,Fbut for too long Westminster has stood
OL,15,Fby while they have been in decline.
OL,16,FThis Government is committed to
OL,17,Frestoring our high streets and
OL,18,Fbringing back hope across Britain."
OL,26,@oD@AOUrD@DO]tD@KOUzD@cO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30609
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786434481
OL,3,CBurnham to give councils more powers
OL,4,Cto crack down on new betting and vape
OL,5,Cshops
OL,7,FThe Centre for Social Justice think
OL,8,Ftank, which found in its analysis that
OL,9,FBritain has lost nearly 1,800 pubs and
OL,10,Fbars while the number of vape and
OL,11,Ftobacco shops has risen to almost
OL,12,F2,200 since 2016, welcomed the plans.
OL,14,FJoshua Nicholson, head of housing and
OL,15,Fcommunities at the think tank, said:
OL,16,F"The Government is right to give
OL,17,Fcouncils new powers to say no to these
OL,18,Fdodgy shops. High street renewal is
OL,19,Fvital to restoring security within our
OL,20,Fcommunities."
OL,26,@xD@AOU|D@MO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
