PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786434481
OL,3,CBurnham to give councils more powers
OL,4,Cto crack down on new betting and vape
OL,5,Cshops
OL,7,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,8,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,9,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,10,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,12,FBut the Betting and Gaming Council
OL,13,Fdisputed any suggestion that betting
OL,14,Fshops were spreading unchecked and
OL,15,Finsisted the real threat to high
OL,16,Fstreets was "more empty units and
OL,17,Ffewer local jobs, not businesses
OL,18,Frooted in the communities they serve".
OL,26,@xD@MOUzD@eO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
