FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30611
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786434481
OL,3,CBurnham to give councils more powers
OL,4,Cto crack down on new betting and vape
OL,5,Cshops
OL,7,FA spokesperson for the industry body
OL,8,Fsaid: "We support tough action against
OL,9,Fcriminal operators and agree local
OL,10,Fpeople should have a proper say over
OL,11,Ftheir high streets. But the suggestion
OL,12,Fthat betting shops are spreading
OL,13,Funchecked is simply wrong.
OL,15,F"Betting shop numbers have fallen by
OL,16,Fover a third since 2019. Around 3,000
OL,17,Fshops have closed and over 15,000 jobs
OL,18,Fhave already been lost.
OL,26,@pD@GOUwD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30612
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786434481
OL,3,CBurnham to give councils more powers
OL,4,Cto crack down on new betting and vape
OL,5,Cshops
OL,7,F"It is wrong to lump highly regulated,
OL,8,Flicensed betting shops together with
OL,9,Frogue or criminal businesses. Betting
OL,10,Fshops still support 37,500 jobs, bring
OL,11,Fvital footfall to neighbouring
OL,12,Fbusinesses and, for many customers,
OL,13,Fare valued community hubs."
OL,15,FThe Conservatives and Reform said the
OL,16,Fproposals would lead to "more empty"
OL,17,Fshops, urging Labour to go further.
OL,26,@oD@AOUuD@[O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30613
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786434481
OL,3,CBurnham to give councils more powers
OL,4,Cto crack down on new betting and vape
OL,5,Cshops
OL,7,FShadow communities secretary Sir James
OL,8,FCleverly said Labour's business rates
OL,9,Fhikes have "hollowed out our high
OL,10,Fstreets, driving out the shops people
OL,11,Fwant and leaving empty units for
OL,12,Fwhoever is left standing to fill".
OL,14,F"Conservatives would cut business
OL,15,Frates for high street firms and back
OL,16,Fthe small businesses that give a town
OL,17,Fcentre its character," he added.
OL,19,FReform UK Treasury spokesman Robert
OL,20,FJenrick said the policy will create
OL,21,Fmore empty shops on our high streets.
OL,26,@vD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30614
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786434481
OL,3,CBurnham to give councils more powers
OL,4,Cto crack down on new betting and vape
OL,5,Cshops
OL,7,F"Preventing businesses from opening
OL,8,Fonly works if the Government and local
OL,9,Fcouncils make it attractive for the
OL,10,Fright kind of shops to open in their
OL,11,Fplace," he said.
OL,13,F"Labour is doing the opposite by
OL,14,Fmaking life harder for small,
OL,15,Flegitimate businesses to operate on
OL,16,Four high streets."
OL,26,@oD@AOUuD@AOUxD@RO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G14/15
