PN,30615
SC,0015
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786434481
OL,3,CBurnham to give councils more powers
OL,4,Cto crack down on new betting and vape
OL,5,Cshops
OL,7,FLiberal Democrat home affairs
OL,8,Fspokesperson Max Wilkinson said:
OL,9,F"Unless he beefs up powers to properly
OL,10,Fcrack down on vape shops and dodgy
OL,11,Foperators, Burnham's plans could go up
OL,12,Fin a puff of smoke."
OL,26,@qD@AOU
